{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-witt-vector-lift","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:witt-vector-lift","kind":"definition","title":"Witt vector lift of a formal group","leanRef":"qou:QOU.WittVectorLift","text":"witt-vector-lift.md","leanSource":"witt-vector-lift.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:witt-vector-lift\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code> be a perfect field of characteristic <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code>, let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">W(k)</code> be its ring of Witt vectors, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varphi\\colon W(k)\\to k</code> be the reduction map. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code> be a formal group law over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code>. A <strong>Witt vector lift</strong> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code> is a formal group law <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code> over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">W(k)</code>, of the same dimension, whose base change along <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varphi</code> is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">G \\otimes_{W(k),\\,\\varphi} k \\;=\\; H .</code></pre>\n<p>If <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code> is commutative then so is its reduction. The definition asserts nothing about existence or uniqueness of a lift, and it does not involve a Poisson structure.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/witt-vector-lift.md","heading":"Definition","number":"5.8.1","page":"b/def-witt-vector-lift","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":105},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.WittVectorLift","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/witt-vector-lift.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
